   953	The main mathematical advance is therefore exact but limited: the geometric
   954	name/proximity problem is not the obstruction.  A Corollary-7.4 packet
   955	canonically determines a flag and a contact flow.  The unproved leap is that a
   956	polynomial Keller packet cannot distribute that flow.  KPC is the minimal
   957	named lemma for that leap; PFE is the separate global quadratic-coverage
   958	lemma.  Both remain labelled **CONJECTURE**.

