322:- **Campaign:** **No.** A local $\mathbb A^1$-degree idea is only listed in [sol-lateral.md](sol-lateral.md); no motivic or intersection-homology calculation was run.
324:- **Cheapest experiment — 3/10.** Compute the local/global $\mathbb A^1$-degree balance and intersection homology for one explicit low-sheet nonproper model, checking whether it yields a constraint not already equivalent to sheet counting.
