    61	
    62	- **Essence.** Order bracket equations by a face valuation so unsupported columns force coefficients in sequence and leave an impossible unit monomial.
    63	- **Campaign:** **Yes.** [LEMMA.md](../LEMMA.md), [LEMMA-REVIEW.md](../LEMMA-REVIEW.md), [SURPLUS.md](../SURPLUS.md), [SURPLUS-EXT.md](../SURPLUS-EXT.md), and [FACE-ISOLATION.md](../FACE-ISOLATION.md) establish exact scoped collapses; Lean checks two core identities in [lean/README.md](../lean/README.md).
