   279	
   280	mu(F) = 6 EXACT by Bezout with infinity corrections: 168*252 = 42336;
   281	(C.{g=c}) at [1:0:0] = 126*252 - 6 = 31746 (the -6 is the two g-poles,
   282	order 1/14 in u each over 42 conjugates); at [0:1:0] = 42*252 = 10584;
   283	affine remainder 42336 - 31746 - 10584 = 6. Note mu(F) = 6 = td =
   284	deg ghat: three independently defined 6's agree — a real consistency
   285	hit, not bookkeeping.
