   287	Structure of A(F) implied by the template: at least two component
   288	families — B-side (punctures with (f,g) -> (a, c_p(a)), Sigma-lambda = 2
   289	charge) and x-side (psi = 2 charge); each carries multiplicity drop
   290	e_p >= 1 with Sum_{p over a value} e_p <= mu(F) = 6 (per-value swallow
   291	ceiling). (RH) forces the TOTAL excess Sum(e_p - 1) = 2g + 6 >= 6: at
   292	least 6 units of asymptotic multiplicity excess, so A(F) has either
   293	several components or high-multiplicity ones — consistent with, and now
   294	quantifying, the lambda/psi charge bookkeeping. Feasible assignments
   295	exist (engine sec 9), e.g. one B-place with e = 1 plus six x-places with
